  "fullDescription": "Check out this adorable collection of hand drawn Safari Animal Clipart.\nBundle includes 9 cute safari animal designs that both kids and adults will simply love!\n\nDesigns are in Kawaii style and will give your crafts a cute and cheerful look 🙂\nAnimals included in this bundle are – leopard, giraffe, zebra, lion, elephant, gnu, croc, rhino and hippo.\nThey are simple to work with and to use. You just need to upload your favorite design in Cricut Design Space or Silhouette Studio and get crafty!\n\nThese Kawaii Cartoon Animal Clipart Illustrations are perfect for designing kids crafts, DIY birthday gifts, cards, baby shower gifts, nursery decor, T-shirt designs, vinyl crafts, stickers and decals, apparel, wall art and much more.\n\n– designs are hand painted and don’t contain AI elements\n\nHave fun crafting with these little creatures 🙂\n\nYou will receive:\n\n9 SVG\n9 PNG ( 300dpi – Transparent )\n9 EPS\n9 DXF\n\n– Watermark is NOT going to be included on purchased files\n– Image files are large & high quality 300dpi – 6400x6400px – 21.3×21.3″\n\n– This is a digital download item, NOT a physical one\n\nThe icons of SVG files on some computers might have an appearance of internet browser (HTML). It’s something that new Windows simply does. However it’s only the icon look, so no worries, they are SVG files that can be opened and will work with all SVG supporting apps, softwares and machines.\n\nIf you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.\n\nHappy crafting!\n\n© 2019.Ivy’sCreativityHouse all rights reserved",
